// expect-error: `Len * bool`: a unit multiplies and divides by an f64 or by another unit (a struct marked @dimension), got bool
// Expected to FAIL (CE4): a unit times a bool (CL10).
@dimension(m = 1)
struct Len {
    value: f64,
}

fn main() -> i64 {
    val d: Len = Len { value: 3.0 };
    val x: Len = d * true;
    println(int_to_str(x.value as i64));
    return 0;
}
